9035330_841132351058997_723153558450432834_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iHgb3tWaNWQQ7kNvwEpNYCE&_nc_oc=AdqdzWJzwcIX3U8pXzyoimHsW6xdXxiWTQY6HNlQyL1H1jR3ECFhb_w16vOXWL5cQug&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6OzPhTdiNvpy9aE8p_HbzTvMf0SEKUipoK2CL-S2opFg&oe=6A01C85C"}, "display_name": "Reaction of Zinc with Sulfuric Acid ", "keywords": [], "long_description": "XR Guru's VR Chemistry Lab presents an exceptional and immersive educational experience for exploring the reaction of zinc with sulfuric acid. Inside this virtual laboratory, users are invited to actively engage in experiments, explore the distinctive properties of the substances involved, and witness the fascinating reactions that transpire in a secure and interactive environment.\n\nAn expert virtual lab assistant stands ready to guide you through the experiment process, offering outstanding support and expertise. Additionally, users can conduct independent experiments, further solidifying their understanding without external assistance.\n\nThis remarkable platform redefines the learning experience by simulating these experiments in an immersive and interactive manner, ensuring a comprehensive grasp of the zinc and sulfuric acid reaction while enhancing long-term knowledge retention.", "short_description": "XR Guru's VR Chemistry Lab presents an exceptional and immersive educational experience for exploring the reaction of zinc with sulfuric acid. Inside this virtual laboratory, users are invited to actively engage in experiments, explore the distinctive properties of the substances involved, and witness the fascinating reactions that transpire in a secure and interactive environment."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.holopundits.com/privacy-policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Holo Pundits", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.holopundits.com/", "category": null, "